<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Precision started strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Precision started strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Precision Corp with a strong buy rating on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 46-1/2 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- The Portland, Ore., company makes structural investment castings for aircraft engines.</p>
